  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63268,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 185,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Fallopian tube</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:35:44"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63269,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 185,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>There is nodular scarring of the fallopian tubes. The tubes may be radiologically unremarkable or show scarring and nodularity as the condition progresses.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:35:44"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63270,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 185,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Its incidence ranges from 0.6% to 11%. There is a strong association with both infertility and ectopic pregnancy {26630221; 7859911}. It is located predominantly in the isthmus (72%) and in both the isthmus and the ampulla in 28% of cases. It is more common in the right side (63%) {25463639}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:35:44"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63271,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 185,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:35:44"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63272,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 185,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:35:44"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63273,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 185,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The lesion comprises one or more discrete firm nodules in the proximal tube, covered by smooth normal serosa.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:35:44"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63274,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 185,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The isthmic/proximal segment of the tube shows variably sized, dilated glandular structures lined by ciliated, columnar epithelium. The glandular structures are surrounded by hypertrophic muscle. A histological classification based on the microscopic depth of the lumen lined with tubal epithelium within the myosalpinx has been proposed {25463639}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:35:44"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63275,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 185,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:35:44"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
