        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 185,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> variably sized, dilated glandular structures lined by ciliated, columnar epithelium surrounded by hypertrophic smooth muscle.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:35:44"
      }
    ],
